                        "review": "One of my favorite games of all time. Unfortunately, the developer Chucklefish, in their usual unprofessional fashion, silently abandoned support for this game about one year ago. This is important because [b]the feature to upload custom content to the game's online library is broken.[/b] I am not sure if this is because Chucklefish have shut down their game's servers, or if an error/bug just appeared one day and nobody bothered to fix it - knowing the company, it could easily be either. In any case, the advertised ability to create maps and \"play them with your friends\" is totally nonfunctional (unless you are playing locally, that is, in-person). For long-time players and dedicated fans, this is a huge detriment, so... buyer beware.\n\nStrangely, you can still download custom maps that were uploaded to the servers before this issue started.",
